'lc($val) eq "bulb" ? 0 : Image::ExifTool::Exif::ConvertFraction($val)',
        }
    ],
    0x24 => {
        Name         => 'ExposureCompensation2',
        Condition    => '$$self{Model} =~ /^DSLR-(A450|A500|A550)/',
        Notes        => 'A450, A500 and A550',
        Format       => 'int16s',
        ValueConv    => '$val / 8',
